EESchema-DOCLIB  Version 2.0
#
$CMP R
D Resistor
F ~
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP C
D Unpolarized capacitor
F ~
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP C_Polarized
D Polarized capacitor
F ~
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP D_Zener
D Zener diode
F ~
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP LED
D Light emitting diode
F ~
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP DRV8701ERGET
D Texas Instruments DRV8701E PH/EN, RGE24 VQFN + exposed ground pad
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP TPS25910RSAR
D TI TPS25910 high-side eFuse: active-low EN16; IN1/2/3; internally common OUT10/11/12 (10 represents power output); GND EP17
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP TPH1R403NL
D Toshiba N-MOSFET SOP Advance: 1/2/3 source, 4 gate, 5/6/7/8 drain; thermal pad is drain
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP XT30_OUTPUT
D Motor output connector; source schematic numbering retained
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP XT30_POWER
D External 12 V supply entry; Rev B connected supply drives VM_RAW and GND
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP CONTROL_4PIN
D External controller signal entry; original connector has no ground terminal
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP SS12D10G4
D SPDT slide switch: pin 2 common; pins 1 and 3 throws; see instance nets for function
$ENDCMP
#
#End Doc Library
